    "\n",
    "url = 'https://us.soccerway.com/international/world/world-cup/2022-qatar/group-stage/r49519/'"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a6acc984",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**Step 2: Send the Request**\n",
    "\n",
    "Using the command `requests.get(url)`, we send the request for the specified URL.\n",
    "What we get back, is the response (stored in the variable response)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "3e2d54ca-982d-4c5b-ae4b-616113a015d3",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# Sending a request to the URL. What we get is the response.\n",
    "\n",
    "response = requests.get(url)"
   ]
  },
